From: Khoa Pham <khoa.pham@radixark.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] Bound dense prefill logits and candidate mask allocations

Backport of SGLang commit cb8dd033ab54af8904733199dbae94270c3395ce
onto e087e662ba1ac4ef7747537e2a9141085efd4561 with commit
0d5e663b8f8d80a6caec2a7f7ce4eed6394756b7 applied. Retain the pinned
backend's self.candidate_masks storage and _mask_topk_scores interface.
The dense path publishes only bounded-replay tail rows without context
parallelism; context-parallel requests retain full mask publication.

